# Manual dev servers only

The user runs EdLernity locally themselves. **Never** auto-start or restart services.

## Do NOT run unless the user explicitly asks in this message

- `npm start`, `npm run dev`, `nodemon`, `node index.js`
- `lsof -ti:5001 | xargs kill`, or any kill/restart on ports **3000**, **3001**, **5001**
- Background shells (`block_until_ms: 0`) to keep servers running
- ngrok or other tunnels

## Allowed without asking

- Read-only checks: `curl`, build once (`npm run build`), lint, tests
- Explain how the user can start servers in their own terminal

## Ports (reference)

| Service | Port |
|---------|------|
| React app | 3000 |
| CRM (Next.js) | 3001 |
| Backend API | 5001 |

If verification needs a running server, tell the user which command to run — do not run it for them.
